91 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 72 0 R
/E (The modern environment, marked by prolonged sedentary behaviour and high cognitive demands, has become a major public health concern. Insufficient physical activity contributes to a wide spectrum of problems, including obesity, cardiovascular disease, musculoskeletal discomfort \(particularly back pain\), and elevated stress levels. These consequences extend beyond individual well-being, imposing substantial economic burdens through reduced productivity, presence and absence. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
92 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 72 0 R
/T (Micro-Breaks as a Preventive Strategy )
/E (Micro-Breaks as a Preventive Strategy )
/Pg 11 0 R
